# The appearances image builds the pod program from the Go sources, as
# the Go images do, and writes its SBOM record from pin.toml, which
# .dockerignore keeps out of every other build. So this file leaves out
# what .dockerignore leaves out, except pin.toml. Every entry below
# repeats one of .dockerignore, which says why each one stays out.
deploy
docs
plans
testdata
local
media-browser
appearances
titles
corrosion
skills
smoke
coverage.out
coverage-media-browser.xml
README.md
LICENSE
/library-operator
latest.sh
